4\" numtexte=\"2018-771\" sens=\"cible\" typelien=\"MODIFIE\">LOI n°2018-771 du 5 septembre 2018 - art. 64</LIEN>\n\n\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006069577\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000006307959\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"158\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"source\" typelien=\"CITATION\">Code général des impôts, CGI. - art. 158</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006071367\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000006585680\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"L741-9\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"source\" typelien=\"CITATION\">Code rural - art. L741-9</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006072050\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000006902850\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"L3232-6\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"cible\" typelien=\"CITATION\">Code du travail - art. L3232-6 (V)</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006072050\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000006648992\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"L352-3\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"cible\" typelien=\"CONCORDE\">Code du travail - art. L352-3 (AbD)</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006072050\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000054468644\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"L5524-6\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"cible\" typelien=\"CITATION\">Code du travail - art. L5524-6 (VD)</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006072050\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGITEXT000006072050\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"source\" typelien=\"CONCORDANCE\">Code du travail L352-3 alinéa 1</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006069577\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000027565898\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"231 bis D\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"cible\" typelien=\"CITATION\">Code général des impôts, CGI. - art. 231 bis D (V)</LIEN>\n<LIEN cidtexte=\"LEGITEXT000006073189\" datesignatexte=\"2999-01-01\" id=\"LEGIARTI000006741514\" naturetexte=\"CODE\" nortexte=\"\" num=\"L131-2\" numtexte=\"\" sens=\"sourc